Leo: I''d love a home computer that does all the housework for me.
Mia: Really? Why that one?
Leo: Because then I''d have far more leisure time after school.
Mia: That makes sense. I would choose walls that can move.
Leo: Moving walls? What for?
Mia: So I could make my room larger for a party and smaller again later.
Leo: That sounds like a lot of fun. Maybe one day we''ll have both.', 'Mia 问 Leo 若能在家拥有一项未来科技会选什么;Leo 想要替他做全部家务的家用电脑,因为放学后能多些闲暇;Mia 想要能移动的墙,这样可以为聚会把房间变大、之后再变小;两人都觉得有趣。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What piece of technology does Leo want?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A home computer that does the housework.","A car that drives itself.","A glass dome roof.","A robot nanny."]},{"q":"Why does Leo want it?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["To save money.","To have more leisure time after school.","To travel abroad.","To learn a language."]},{"q":"What does Mia want instead?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Walls that can move.","A kitchen robot.","A flying car.","A bigger phone."]},{"q":"Why does Mia want moving walls?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["To keep out the cold.","To change the size of her room.","To save electricity.","To block the noise."]},{"q":"How do the two friends feel about the ideas?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They think it is dangerous.","They are bored by it.","They think it would be fun.","They dislike technology."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U4', 'sufe');
With a quick look at your phone, you can control the lighting and temperature.
An electronic servant takes over most of the cleaning chores.
It can even pay the bills and order food for you.
Because of this, people who live there enjoy much more free time.', '智能家居把每件设备连成一个网络;只需看一眼手机,你就能控制灯光和温度;电子仆人接管大部分清洁家务;它甚至能替你付账单、订食物;因此住在那里的人享有多得多的空闲时间。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does a smart home connect into one network?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only the windows.","Just the front door.","Only the lights.","Every device in the home."]},{"q":"What can you control with a look at your phone?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The lighting and temperature.","The weather outside.","The neighbours'' homes.","The traffic lights."]},{"q":"What does the electronic servant take over?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Driving the car.","Most of the cleaning chores.","Teaching the children.","Growing food in the field."]},{"q":"What else can the home do for you?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Write your homework.","Sing you a song.","Pay the bills and order food.","Drive you to school."]},{"q":"What do people who live there enjoy?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Higher bills.","Less sleep.","More housework.","Much more free time."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U4', 'sufe');
Visitor: It''s beautiful. Does all the power come from the sun?
Guide: Yes. Most of it comes from solar panels in the round roof.
Visitor: I don''t see any electric sockets on the walls.
Guide: That''s right. Each room has a power wall instead. You attach appliances to it.
Visitor: Amazing. And why does the air smell so fresh?
Guide: The system filters the air and then scents it with a perfume you choose.
Visitor: I could live here happily for the rest of my life.', '导游欢迎参观穹顶之家,提到头顶透明的玻璃屋顶;访客觉得美,问电力是否都来自太阳;导游说大部分来自圆顶里的太阳能板;访客发现墙上没有插座;导游解释每个房间有电力墙,把电器附上去即可;访客问空气为何清新;导游说系统过滤空气再加上你选的香味;访客说愿在此长住。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where does most of the house''s power come from?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Solar panels in the roof.","A large battery in the floor.","The city power station.","Wind outside the dome."]},{"q":"What does the visitor notice is missing from the walls?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Windows.","Electric sockets.","Doors.","Lights."]},{"q":"How do people use electrical appliances in this house?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They plug them into the floor.","They run them on batteries.","They attach them to a power wall.","They share one socket."]},{"q":"Why does the air smell so fresh?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["The windows are always open.","Flowers grow in every room.","The visitor wears perfume.","The system filters and scents the air."]},{"q":"How does the visitor feel about the house?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["He would love to live there.","He finds it frightening.","He thinks it is too small.","He dislikes the smell."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U4', 'sufe');
Because we use our brains so much, the forehead may grow larger.
Our eyes are likely to become stronger over a very long time.
Arms and legs may grow weaker, since machines do the heavy work.
These are only guesses, but they remind us that humans keep changing.', '科学家对未来人类做了一些有趣的预测;因为我们大量用脑,前额可能变大;眼睛在很长时间里可能变得更强;手臂和腿可能变弱,因为机器承担了重活;这些只是猜测,但提醒我们人类一直在变化。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Why might the forehead grow larger?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Because people will wear hats.","Because we use our brains so much.","Because the sun is stronger.","Because hair will grow there."]},{"q":"What may happen to human eyes?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They will close forever.","They will turn blue.","They are likely to become stronger.","They will stop working."]},{"q":"Why might arms and legs grow weaker?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Because people will stop eating.","Because the weather changes.","Because people sleep more.","Because machines do the heavy work."]},{"q":"How does the speaker describe these predictions?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["As only guesses.","As certain facts.","As warnings of danger.","As silly jokes."]},{"q":"What do the predictions remind us of?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["That science is useless.","That humans keep changing.","That the past was better.","That machines are alive."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U4', 'sufe');
Lina: I washed and ironed it last night. It is hanging in the wardrobe.
Sam: Oh, thank you. And is my breakfast ready?
Lina: Yes. It is waiting on the kitchen table, planned just for you.
Sam: Great. What time should I leave for school?
Lina: You should leave in ten minutes, so please don''t be late.
Sam: All right. I''ll be on my way soon.
Lina: I''ll see you back home by six. Have a good day at school.', 'Sam 找不到校服;管家机器人 Lina 说昨晚已洗熨好,挂在衣柜里;Sam 道谢并问早餐;Lina 说已在厨房桌上备好;Sam 问该何时出门;Lina 说十分钟后出发别迟到;Sam 说马上就走;Lina 说六点见,祝在校愉快。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is Sam looking for at first?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["His phone.","His breakfast.","His school uniform.","His shoes."]},{"q":"What had Lina done with the uniform?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["She had thrown it away.","She had given it to a friend.","She had lost it.","She had washed and ironed it."]},{"q":"Where is Sam''s breakfast?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Waiting on the kitchen table.","In the wardrobe.","On the school bus.","Still in the fridge."]},{"q":"When should Sam leave for school?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["At once, with no time left.","In ten minutes.","After lunch.","Tomorrow morning."]},{"q":"What does Lina say at the end?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["She is too busy to help.","Sam should stay at home.","She will see Sam home by six.","Sam has missed the bus."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective1', 'U4', 'sufe');
But it is wise to stay in control of the machines we use.
Let robots do the boring chores, yet keep making your own choices.
Spend your free time on family, friends and the things you love.
In this way, a smart home will serve you, not replace you.', '科技能让未来的家非常舒适;但明智的做法是掌控我们使用的机器;让机器人做无聊的家务,但仍由自己做选择;把空闲时间用在家人、朋友和你热爱的事上;这样,智能家居会为你服务,而不是取代你。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What can technology do for our future homes?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Make them more dangerous.","Make them very dark.","Make them empty.","Make them very comfortable."]},{"q":"What is the wise thing to do with machines?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Stay in control of them.","Turn them all off.","Sell them quickly.","Never use them."]},{"q":"What should robots be left to do?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Make all your choices.","Do the boring chores.","Choose your friends.","Decide your future."]},{"q":"How should you spend your free time?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Watching the robots work.","Worrying about machines.","On family, friends and things you love.","Cleaning all day."]},{"q":"What is the speaker''s main message?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Machines should rule the home.","People should give up technology.","Robots are better than humans.","A smart home should serve you, not replace you."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'elective1', 'U4', 'sufe');

